1
00:00:12,700 --> 00:00:13,800
(Let it go.)

2
00:00:43,724 --> 00:00:45,964
=Revenge From A Wife=

3
00:00:46,091 --> 00:00:48,317
=Episode 23=

4
00:00:48,920 --> 00:00:49,640
Where's the knife?

5
00:00:52,079 --> 00:00:52,799
Your Highness.

6
00:00:53,640 --> 00:00:54,280
Give it to me!

7
00:01:01,640 --> 00:01:02,479
Why are you panicking?

8
00:01:03,119 --> 00:01:04,719
You really think I've lost?

9
00:01:05,240 --> 00:01:06,840
I know His Majesty too well.

10
00:01:07,520 --> 00:01:09,079
He doesn't completely disbelieve

11
00:01:09,719 --> 00:01:11,680
what I told him.

12
00:01:12,879 --> 00:01:14,359
After the scene I caused,

13
00:01:15,040 --> 00:01:17,319
there's a rift between him and Su Cao.

14
00:01:18,000 --> 00:01:19,560
I'll use this chance

15
00:01:20,239 --> 00:01:21,599
to win His Majesty's heart

16
00:01:22,400 --> 00:01:24,359
back once and for all.

17
00:01:36,120 --> 00:01:37,319
Consort Chen says

18
00:01:37,760 --> 00:01:38,799
she angered Your Majesty

19
00:01:39,760 --> 00:01:41,120
because she overstepped.

20
00:01:41,359 --> 00:01:42,879
She deeply regrets it,

21
00:01:42,879 --> 00:01:44,599
so she drew her own blood

22
00:01:44,599 --> 00:01:45,959
and added it to this calming tonic.

23
00:01:46,280 --> 00:01:47,400
She hopes Your Majesty

24
00:01:47,879 --> 00:01:49,120
remains in good health.

25
00:01:57,439 --> 00:01:58,159
Qing'er.

26
00:01:59,000 --> 00:02:00,280
I'll avenge Gen's death

27
00:02:01,120 --> 00:02:02,640
for you. I promise.

28
00:02:02,799 --> 00:02:03,480
Wanniang.

29
00:02:04,120 --> 00:02:05,519
Consort Chen is favored again.

30
00:02:06,200 --> 00:02:06,719
What...

31
00:02:07,400 --> 00:02:08,519
What should we do?

32
00:02:10,280 --> 00:02:11,519
No man is more fickle

33
00:02:11,840 --> 00:02:13,159
than Xiao Che.

34
00:02:13,560 --> 00:02:15,680
Consort Chen fought hard for his favor.

35
00:02:16,759 --> 00:02:19,080
I can easily fool him into favoring me.

36
00:02:19,639 --> 00:02:20,199
Your Highness.

37
00:02:20,400 --> 00:02:22,039
Consort Hui is back in favor.
What should we do?

38
00:02:22,039 --> 00:02:22,800
That woman!

39
00:02:24,400 --> 00:02:26,159
What seductive trick did she use

40
00:02:26,680 --> 00:02:28,039
to get back into His Majesty's bed?

41
00:02:29,120 --> 00:02:29,759
Your Highness.

42
00:02:34,240 --> 00:02:36,280
Roujia, you...

43
00:02:36,280 --> 00:02:36,840
Your Highness!

44
00:02:37,240 --> 00:02:38,479
It's me, Ruolan!

45
00:02:38,479 --> 00:02:39,800
You won't take everything from me!

46
00:02:40,199 --> 00:02:41,919
You couldn't three years ago,

47
00:02:41,919 --> 00:02:42,879
and you won't now!

48
00:02:42,879 --> 00:02:44,400
Die!

49
00:02:44,719 --> 00:02:45,520
Your Highness!

50
00:02:50,360 --> 00:02:51,240
Consort Hui.

51
00:02:54,560 --> 00:02:56,360
Any news from Chenghua Palace?

52
00:02:56,800 --> 00:02:57,159
Mm.

53
00:02:57,560 --> 00:03:00,039
The drug Consort De adds each day
to Noble Consort Chen's calming tonic

54
00:03:00,280 --> 00:03:01,199
is gradually taking effect.

55
00:03:01,919 --> 00:03:04,280
Last night, Consort Chen went mad.

56
00:03:04,639 --> 00:03:06,199
She mistook Ruolan for the late Empress

57
00:03:06,680 --> 00:03:08,400
and nearly strangled her.

58
00:03:11,280 --> 00:03:12,439
She's been spoiled all her life

59
00:03:12,960 --> 00:03:14,240
and can't handle setbacks.

60
00:03:14,960 --> 00:03:16,280
Just losing His Majesty's favor

61
00:03:16,599 --> 00:03:17,879
was enough to drive her mad.

62
00:03:18,879 --> 00:03:20,919
She killed her own sister,

63
00:03:21,199 --> 00:03:23,000
yet she'll never escape her shadow.

64
00:03:24,560 --> 00:03:25,240
Her shadow?

65
00:03:25,560 --> 00:03:26,000
Mm.

66
00:03:29,120 --> 00:03:30,479
(Listen to me.)

67
00:03:31,240 --> 00:03:32,960
(The dead woman's hairpin.)

68
00:03:33,719 --> 00:03:34,599
(Consort Chen)

69
00:03:35,199 --> 00:03:37,039
(will tremble at the sight of it.)

70
00:03:37,479 --> 00:03:39,560
(She'll know no peace in life,)

71
00:03:40,080 --> 00:03:42,960
(nor rest in death.)

72
00:03:44,840 --> 00:03:49,120
(Cursed for all eternity.)

73
00:03:56,240 --> 00:03:57,199
Seven days from now,

74
00:03:57,400 --> 00:03:58,199
during Lantern Festival,

75
00:03:58,919 --> 00:04:00,039
under the lanterns by the stage,

76
00:04:00,560 --> 00:04:02,599
another show will begin.

77
00:04:05,520 --> 00:04:06,360
Consort Chen.

78
00:04:06,479 --> 00:04:07,439
Happy Lantern Festival.

79
00:04:07,840 --> 00:04:08,479
Please, this way.

80
00:04:08,479 --> 00:04:09,560
How thoughtful of you.

81
00:04:09,560 --> 00:04:10,400
Happy Lantern Festival.

82
00:04:11,039 --> 00:04:12,080
Such fine wine.

83
00:04:12,080 --> 00:04:12,680
No one leaves sober tonight!

84
00:04:12,680 --> 00:04:13,280
Your Highness.

85
00:04:14,800 --> 00:04:16,800
The young prince is to perform
for His Majesty tonight,

86
00:04:17,240 --> 00:04:18,759
but he's backstage crying

87
00:04:19,120 --> 00:04:20,159
and asking for you.

88
00:04:22,240 --> 00:04:23,639
What a nuisance.

89
00:04:27,439 --> 00:04:28,360
This aged wine

90
00:04:28,600 --> 00:04:29,720
really is excellent.

91
00:04:31,800 --> 00:04:32,600
Zhao?

92
00:04:36,560 --> 00:04:37,319
Zhao?

93
00:04:48,560 --> 00:04:50,040
You used visiting me as a pretext,

94
00:04:51,000 --> 00:04:52,879
then seduced your own brother-in-law
day after day.

95
00:04:53,759 --> 00:04:54,600
Did you ever feel

96
00:04:55,079 --> 00:04:57,279
even a shred of shame?

97
00:04:57,519 --> 00:04:58,720
Shame?

98
00:04:59,920 --> 00:05:01,519
You were the legitimate daughter,

99
00:05:02,079 --> 00:05:04,399
so catching His Majesty's eye was easy.

100
00:05:05,360 --> 00:05:06,879
I was only a concubine's daughter,

101
00:05:07,600 --> 00:05:09,759
so I could only live in your shadow.

102
00:05:10,360 --> 00:05:12,079
Even fighting for what I wanted

103
00:05:12,879 --> 00:05:14,439
made me shameless in your eyes.

104
00:05:18,759 --> 00:05:20,160
At your wedding,

105
00:05:20,480 --> 00:05:21,959
you gave me this hairpin

106
00:05:22,959 --> 00:05:24,040
and spoke of

107
00:05:24,600 --> 00:05:26,199
sisters joined in heart,

108
00:05:27,000 --> 00:05:28,399
twin blossoms from one root.

109
00:05:29,160 --> 00:05:30,560
Yet the blossom on the higher branch

110
00:05:31,160 --> 00:05:33,720
always outshines the one below.

111
00:05:34,000 --> 00:05:35,560
I knew you were reminding me

112
00:05:36,279 --> 00:05:37,279
that in this life,

113
00:05:37,959 --> 00:05:39,680
I'd always live in your shadow.

114
00:05:46,199 --> 00:05:47,720
Of two blossoms on one stem,

115
00:05:48,199 --> 00:05:49,839
only one can truly shine.

116
00:05:50,560 --> 00:05:51,399
Sister.

117
00:05:51,839 --> 00:05:53,399
You've had all the glory for years.

118
00:05:54,399 --> 00:05:56,120
It's time you stepped aside.

119
00:05:58,279 --> 00:05:59,160
My illness...

120
00:06:02,040 --> 00:06:03,000
It was you?

121
00:06:04,720 --> 00:06:06,120
You finally understand.

122
00:06:07,000 --> 00:06:08,639
Ever since you won His Majesty's favor,

123
00:06:09,120 --> 00:06:10,519
every time I came to the palace,

124
00:06:11,120 --> 00:06:13,759
it was to dose you with poison

125
00:06:14,240 --> 00:06:15,160
that would slowly kill you.

126
00:06:18,920 --> 00:06:19,800
Sister.

127
00:06:20,079 --> 00:06:20,519
Come.

128
00:06:21,040 --> 00:06:21,879
Drink your medicine.

129
00:06:22,240 --> 00:06:23,160
Zhang Yuying!

130
00:06:23,600 --> 00:06:23,920
You...

131
00:06:24,360 --> 00:06:25,639
If you won't drink it,

132
00:06:26,319 --> 00:06:27,800
I can't promise

133
00:06:28,120 --> 00:06:29,519
Zhao will grow up safe and sound.

134
00:06:46,160 --> 00:06:50,347
♪Sunset fades beyond the lonely city♪

135
00:06:50,481 --> 00:06:54,094
♪Dusk snow paints the green hills♪

136
00:06:54,329 --> 00:06:56,928
♪A lone rider storms the old pass♪

137
00:06:56,965 --> 00:06:59,245
♪Drunk, I gaze by lamplight♪

138
00:06:59,292 --> 00:07:03,121
♪Old friends have all drifted away♪

139
00:07:03,523 --> 00:07:06,876
♪My broken sword rusts, as do I♪

140
00:07:07,803 --> 00:07:11,316
♪Jackdaws cry into the night♪

141
00:07:11,816 --> 00:07:14,383
♪Half a banner snaps in the wind♪

142
00:07:14,509 --> 00:07:16,542
♪In dreams, I return to the camps♪

143
00:07:16,609 --> 00:07:20,386
♪Moonlight chills my armor♪

144
00:07:20,736 --> 00:07:25,069
♪Life is a dream through many winters♪

145
00:07:25,292 --> 00:07:28,799
♪I gaze beyond the edge of the world♪

146
00:07:28,980 --> 00:07:31,833
♪Parting sorrow spills across the moon♪

147
00:07:31,900 --> 00:07:37,514
♪The moon and wind mean nothing now♪

148
00:07:37,554 --> 00:07:40,568
♪History turns to ash before ink dries♪

149
00:07:40,609 --> 00:07:46,617
♪Who plays the zither
and sighs at the pavilion?♪

150
00:07:47,284 --> 00:07:54,239
♪The past has faded away♪

151
00:07:54,239 --> 00:07:58,271
♪The past has faded away♪
